    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93037" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάγος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coarse cloak, plaid</i>, used by the Gauls, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.28.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.30.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.30
			</span></i>; by the Spaniards, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; <i>soldier's cloak</i>, Lat. <i>sagum</i>, <i><span class="en">
